h3 3.2.5.2 Kinds of content
text Each element in HTML falls into zero or more  that group elements with similar characteristics together. The following broad categories are used in this specification:
text categories
link "Metadata content" #metadata-content-2
link "Flow content" #flow-content-2
link "Sectioning content" #sectioning-content-2
link "Heading content" #heading-content-2
