text "The first paragraph is overlapped by the other four. A user agent that supports the \"cats.sim\" resource will only show the first one, but a user agent that shows the fallback will confusingly show the first sentence of the first paragraph as if it was in the same paragraph as the second one, and will show the last paragraph as if it was at the start of the second sentence of the first paragraph."
