h3 3.2.6.1 The title attribute
button ✔MDN
text The  attribute  advisory information for the element, such as would be appropriate for a tooltip. On a link, this could be the title or a description of the target resource; on an image, it could be the image credit or a description of the image; on a paragraph, it could be a footnote or commentary on the text; on a citation, it could be further information about the source; on , it could be a label for, or instructions for, use of the element; and so forth. The value is text.
