text "Interactive user agents may provide users with a means to  created using the  element, somewhere within their user interface. Such invocations of the  algorithm must set the  argument to \"\". The exact interface is not defined by this specification, but it could include the following information (obtained from the element's attributes, again as defined below), in some form or another (possibly simplified), for each  created with each  element in the document:"
