text The schema.org microdata vocabulary can be used to provide the publication date for an  element, using one of the CreativeWork subtypes. success
link article #the-article-element
text When the main content of the page (i.e. excluding footers, headers, navigation blocks, and sidebars) is all one single self-contained composition, that content may be marked with an , but it is technically redundant in that case (since it's self-evident that the page is a single composition, as it is a single document).
link article #the-article-element
