text Name-value groups may be terms and definitions, metadata topics and values, questions and answers, or any other groups of name-value data.
text The values within a group are alternatives; multiple paragraphs forming part of the same value must all be given within the same  element.
link dd #the-dd-element
text The order of the list of groups, and of the names and values within each group, may be significant.
text In order to annotate groups with  attributes, or other  that apply to whole groups, or just for styling purposes, each group in a  element can be wrapped in a  element. This does not change the semantics of the  element.
