text Small print typically features disclaimers, caveats, legal restrictions, or copyrights. Small print is also sometimes used for attribution, or for satisfying licensing requirements. success
text "The  element does not \"de-emphasize\" or lower the importance of text emphasized by the  element or marked as important with the  element. To mark text as not emphasized or important, simply do not mark it up with the  or  elements respectively." success
