text The  element should not be used for extended spans of text, such as multiple paragraphs, lists, or sections of text. It is only intended for short runs of text. The text of a page listing terms of use, for instance, would not be a suitable candidate for the  element: in such a case, the text is not a side comment, it is the main content of the page.
link small #the-small-element
link small #the-small-element
text The  element must not be used for subheadings; for that purpose, use the  element.
