text The  attribute on  that create , if present, gives the language of the linked resource. It is purely advisory. The value must be a valid BCP 47 language tag.  User agents must not consider this attribute authoritative — upon fetching the resource, user agents must use only language information associated with the resource to determine its language, not metadata included in the link to the resource.
