text User agents should allow the user to adjust this behavior, for example in conjunction with a setting that disables the sending of HTTP `` (sic) headers. Based on the user's preferences, UAs may either  the  attribute altogether, or selectively ignore URLs in the list (e.g. ignoring any third-party URLs); this is explicitly accounted for in the steps above.
link Referer https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc7231.html#header.referer
