text The  keyword is a specialized alternative to the  keyword, with a processing model geared toward preloading . In particular, it uses the specific fetch behavior for module scripts (including, e.g., a different interpretation of the  attribute), and places the result into the appropriate  for later evaluation. In contrast, a similar  using the  keyword would place the result in the preload cache, without affecting the document's .
