text Additionally, implementations can take advantage of the fact that  declare their dependencies in order to fetch the specified module's dependency as well. This is intended as an optimization opportunity, since the user agent knows that, in all likelihood, those dependencies will also be needed later. It will not generally be observable without using technology such as service workers, or monitoring on the server side. Notably, the appropriate  or  events will occur after the specified module is fetched, and will not wait for any dependencies.
