text Assume that the module graph for the application is as follows:
image https://html.spec.whatwg.org/images/ircfog-modules.svg "The module graph is rooted at app.mjs, which depends on irc.mjs and fog-machine.mjs. In turn, irc.mjs depends on helpers.mjs."
text "Here we see the application developer has used  to declare all of the modules in their module graph, ensuring that the user agent initiates fetches for them all. Without such preloading, the user agent might need to go through multiple network roundtrips before discovering , if technologies such as HTTP/2 Server Push are not in play. In this way,   elements can be used as a sort of \"manifest\" of the application's modules."
