h3 4.6.8.26 Sequential link types
text Some documents form part of a sequence of documents.
text A sequence of documents is one where each document can have a previous sibling and a next sibling. A document with no previous sibling is the start of its sequence, a document with no next sibling is the end of its sequence.
text A document may be part of multiple sequences.
