h3 4.8.4 Images
h3 4.8.4.1 Introduction
text This section is non-normative.
text To embed an image in HTML, when there is only a single image resource, use the  element and its  attribute.
row
  link img #the-img-element
  link src #attr-img-src
text From today's featured article   Marie Lloyd (1870–1922) was an English  music hall singer, ...
