h3 4.8.4.4.4 A short phrase or label with an alternative graphical representation: icons, logos
text A document can contain information in iconic form. The icon is intended to help users of visual browsers to recognize features at a glance.
text In some cases, the icon is supplemental to a text label conveying the same meaning. In those cases, the  attribute must be present but must be empty.
link alt #attr-img-alt
