text Sometimes the entire point of the image is that a textual description is not available, and the user is to provide the description. For instance, the point of a CAPTCHA image is to see if the user can literally read the graphic. Here is one way to mark up a CAPTCHA (note the  attribute):
link title #attr-title
text What does this image say?     (If you cannot see the image, you can use an  audio test instead.)
