text Notice the way that quotes have to be escaped (otherwise the  attribute would end prematurely), and the way raw ampersands (e.g. in URLs or in prose) mentioned in the sandboxed content have to be  escaped — once so that the ampersand is preserved when originally parsing the  attribute, and once more to prevent the ampersand from being misinterpreted when parsing the sandboxed content.
