text In particular, this content is not intended to address accessibility concerns. To make audio content accessible to the deaf or to those with other physical or cognitive disabilities, a variety of features are available. If captions or a sign language video are available, the  element can be used instead of the  element to play the audio, allowing users to enable the visual alternatives. Chapter titles can be provided to aid navigation, using the  element and a . And, naturally, transcripts or other textual alternatives can be provided by simply linking to them in the prose near the  element. success
