text In the example above, the audio files load as follows:
text 1.mp3, 2.mp3, 5.mp3
text The audio file loads eagerly and delays the window's load event.
text 3.mp3
text The audio loads when layout is known, due to being in the viewport, however it does not delay the window's load event.
text 4.mp3
text The audio loads and autoplay playback begins when layout is known, due to being in the viewport, however it does not delay the window's load event.
text 6.mp3
text The audio loads only once scrolled into the viewport, and does not delay the window's load event.
text 7.mp3
text The audio loads and autoplay playback begins only once scrolled into the viewport, and does not delay the window's load event.
text 8.mp3
text The audio's metadata loads only once scrolled into the viewport, and does not delay the window's load event.
