text Data for the immediate  is available, as well as enough data for the user agent to advance the  in the  at least a little without immediately reverting to the  state, and . For example, in video this corresponds to the user agent having data for at least the current frame and the next frame when the  is at the instant in time between the two frames, or to the user agent having the video data for the current frame and audio data to keep playing at least a little when the  is in the middle of a frame. The user agent cannot be in this state if , as the  can never advance in this case.
