text The   by the fetching algorithm on the  to process the data as it is being fetched must determine the type of the resource. If the type of the resource is not a supported text track format, the load will fail, as described below. Otherwise, the resource's data must be passed to the appropriate parser (e.g., the ) as it is received, with the  being used for that parser's output.
