text Authors may also use other techniques, or combinations of the above techniques, as appropriate.
text The best option, of course, rather than writing a description explaining the way the table is laid out, is to adjust the table such that no explanation is needed.
text In the case of the table used in the examples above, a simple rearrangement of the table so that the headers are on the top and left sides removes the need for an explanation as well as removing the need for the use of  attributes:
link headers #attr-tdth-headers
