text In this example, we see a snippet of a web application consisting of a grid of editable cells (essentially a simple spreadsheet). One of the cells has been configured to show the sum of the cells above it. Three have been marked as headings, which use  elements instead of  elements. A script would attach event handlers to these elements to maintain the total.
