h3 4.10.1.7 The difference between the field type, the autofill field name, and the input modality
text This section is non-normative.
text "The , , and  attributes can seem confusingly similar. For instance, in all three cases, the string \"\" is a valid value. This section attempts to illustrate the difference between the three attributes and provides advice suggesting how to use them."
