text Unlike the  and  types, the  type does not enforce a particular syntax. This is intentional; in practice, telephone number fields tend to be free-form fields, because there are a wide variety of valid phone numbers. Systems that need to enforce a particular format are encouraged to use the  attribute or the  method to hook into the client-side validation mechanism. success
