text The  attribute represents a  hint (a word or short phrase) intended to aid the user with data entry when the control has no value. A hint could be a sample value or a brief description of the expected format. The attribute, if specified, must have a value that contains no U+000A LINE FEED (LF) or U+000D CARRIAGE RETURN (CR) characters.
row
  text placeholder
  text short
text The  attribute should not be used as an alternative to a . For a longer hint or other advisory text, the  attribute is more appropriate.
