text The  element  the completion progress of a task. The progress is either indeterminate, indicating that progress is being made but that it is not clear how much more work remains to be done before the task is complete (e.g. because the task is waiting for a remote host to respond), or the progress is a number in the range zero to a maximum, giving the fraction of work that has so far been completed.
row
  link progress #the-progress-element
  link represents #represents
button ✔MDN
text There are two attributes that determine the current task completion represented by the element. The  attribute specifies how much of the task has been completed, and the  attribute specifies how much work the task requires in total. The units are arbitrary and not specified.
