text If the progress bar is a determinate progress bar and the element has a  attribute, the user agent must parse the  attribute's value according to the . If this does not result in an error, and if the parsed value is greater than zero, then the  of the progress bar is that value. Otherwise, if the element has no  attribute, or if it has one but parsing it resulted in an error, or if the parsed value was less than or equal to zero, then the  of the progress bar is 1.0.
