text A number of user agents historically implemented special support for first-in-form text controls with the name isindex, and this specification previously defined related user agent requirements for it. However, some user agents subsequently dropped that special support, and the related requirements were removed from this specification. So, to avoid problematic reinterpretations in legacy user agents, the name isindex is no longer allowed. success
text Other than , any non-empty value for  is allowed. An  match for the name  is special: if used as the name of a  control with no  attribute, then during submission the  attribute is automatically given a value consisting of the submission character encoding.
