h3 4.10.19.7 Autofill
h3 4.10.19.7.1 Autofilling form controls: the autocomplete attribute
button ✔MDN
text User agents sometimes have features for helping users fill forms in, for example prefilling the user's address based on earlier user input. The  content attribute can be used to hint to the user agent how to, or indeed whether to, provide such a feature.
text autocomplete
text There are two ways this attribute is used. When wearing the , the  attribute describes what input is expected from users. When wearing the , the  attribute describes the meaning of the given value.
text autofill expectation mantle
