text This might render as follows:
image https://html.spec.whatwg.org/images/select-country-1.png "A drop-down control with a long alphabetical list of countries."
text "Suppose that on the first visit to this page, the user selects \"Zambia\". On the second visit, the user agent could duplicate the entry for Zambia at the top of the list, so that the interface instead looks like this:"
image https://html.spec.whatwg.org/images/select-country-2.png "The same drop-down control with the alphabetical list of countries, but with Zambia as an entry at the top."
text "When the  is \"\", the user agent should attempt to use heuristics to determine the most appropriate values to offer the user, e.g. based on the element's  value, the position of the element in its , what other fields exist in the form, and so forth."
