text "For example, it would not be conforming if the user agent decided that it should offer the address it knows to be the user's daughter's address for \"section-child\" and the addresses it knows to be the user's spouses' addresses for \"section-spouse\"."
text The autocompletion mechanism must be implemented by the user agent acting as if the user had modified the , and must be done at a time where the element is  (e.g. just after the element has been inserted into the document, or when the user agent ). User agents must only prefill controls using values that the user could have entered.
