text Given the same user input, the result on submission is quite different: the user agent instead does an HTTP POST to the given URL, with as the entity body something like the following text:
text "------kYFrd4jNJEgCervE Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\"t\" cats ------kYFrd4jNJEgCervE Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\"q\" fur ------kYFrd4jNJEgCervE--"
