text When the element is created, if the attribute is absent, the additional information should be hidden; if the attribute is present, that information should be shown. Subsequently, if the attribute is removed, then the information should be hidden; if the attribute is added, the information should be shown.
text The user agent should allow the user to request that the additional information be shown or hidden. To honor a request for the details to be shown, the user agent must  the  attribute on the element to the empty string. To honor a request for the information to be hidden, the user agent must  the  attribute from the element.
