link open #attr-dialog-open
text Showing a dialog is different from opening one. Opening a dialog consists of creating and showing that dialog (similar to how  both creates and shows a new window). Whereas showing the dialog is the process of taking a  element that is already in the DOM, and making it interactive and visible to the user. success
