text "The requirement that  must be denoted using a  is in place to avoid potential future collisions. Values for the  attribute that are not MIME types, like \"\" or \"\", are used by the standard to denote types of scripts which have special behavior in user agents. By using a valid MIME type string now, you ensure that your data block will not ever be reinterpreted as a different script type, even in future user agents." success
