text For external , if the  attribute is present, then the classic script will be fetched  to parsing and evaluated as soon as it is available (potentially before parsing completes). If the  attribute is not present but the  attribute is present, then the classic script will be fetched  and evaluated when the page has finished parsing. If neither attribute is present, then the script is fetched and evaluated immediately, blocking parsing until these are both complete.
