text For , if the  attribute is present, then the module script and all its dependencies will be fetched  to parsing, and the module script will be evaluated as soon as it is available (potentially before parsing completes). Otherwise, the module script and its dependencies will be fetched  to parsing and evaluated when the page has finished parsing. (The  attribute has no effect on module scripts.)
link "module scripts" #module-script
