text The  2D rendering context represents a flat linear Cartesian surface whose origin (0,0) is at the top left corner, with the coordinate space having  values increasing when going right, and  values increasing when going down. The -coordinate of the right-most edge is equal to the width of the rendering context's  in ; similarly, the -coordinate of the bottom-most edge is equal to the height of the rendering context's  in .
