text The  boolean can be useful when implementing certain kinds of applications, such as drawing applications, where the latency between input and rasterization is critical. success
link desynchronized #concept-canvas-desynchronized
text The  object also has a  boolean. When a  object's  is true, the user agent may optimize the canvas for readback operations.
