text "On most devices the user agent needs to decide whether to store the canvas's  on the GPU (this is also called \"hardware accelerated\"), or on the CPU (also called \"software\"). Most rendering operations are more performant for accelerated canvases, with the major exception being readback with , , or .  objects with  equal to true tell the user agent that the webpage is likely to perform many readback operations and that it is advantageous to use a software canvas." success
