text Create a new  that describes the edge of the areas that would be covered if a straight line of length equal to 's  was swept along each subpath in  while being kept at an angle such that the line is orthogonal to the path being swept, replacing each point with the end cap necessary to satisfy 's  attribute as described previously and elaborated below, and replacing each join with the join necessary to satisfy 's  type, as defined below.
