h3 4.12.5.1.8 Transformations
text Objects that implement the  interface have a , as well as methods (described in this section) to manipulate it. When an object implementing the  interface is created, its transformation matrix must be initialized to the identity matrix.
link CanvasTransform #canvastransform
text current transformation matrix
link CanvasTransform #canvastransform
text The  is applied to coordinates when creating the , and when painting text, shapes, and  objects, on objects implementing the  interface.
