text "Place a copy of the image on the bitmap, anchored such that its top left corner is at the origin of the coordinate space, with one coordinate space unit per  of the image, then place repeated copies of this image horizontally to the left and right, if the repetition behavior is \"\", or vertically up and down, if the repetition behavior is \"\", or in all four directions all over the bitmap, if the repetition behavior is \"\"."
link "CSS pixel" https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#px
