text If a radial gradient or repeated pattern is used when the transformation matrix is singular, then the resulting style must be  (otherwise the gradient or pattern would be collapsed to a point or line, leaving the other pixels undefined). Linear gradients and solid colors always define all points even with singular transformation matrices.
