text The image data must be processed in the original direction, even if the dimensions given are negative.
text When scaling up, if the  attribute is set to true, the user agent should attempt to apply a smoothing algorithm to the image data when it is scaled. User agents which support multiple filtering algorithms may use the value of the  attribute to guide the choice of filtering algorithm when the  attribute is set to true. Otherwise, the image must be rendered using nearest-neighbor interpolation.
link imageSmoothingEnabled #dom-context-2d-imagesmoothingenabled
link imageSmoothingQuality #dom-context-2d-imagesmoothingquality
