h3 4.12.5.2 The ImageBitmap rendering context
h3 4.12.5.2.1 Introduction
text is a performance-oriented interface that provides a low overhead method for displaying the contents of  objects. It uses transfer semantics to reduce overall memory consumption. It also streamlines performance by avoiding intermediate compositing, unlike the  method of .
