text "Even with this rather-complicated element definition, the element is not a pleasure to use for consumers: it will be continually \"sprouting\"  attributes of its own volition, and its choice of  focusability behavior may not match the  behavior on the current platform. This is because as of now there is no way to specify default focus behavior for custom elements, forcing the use of the  attribute to do so (even though it is usually reserved for allowing the consumer to override default behavior)."
