text In contrast, a simple , as shown in the previous section, would automatically inherit the semantics and behavior of the  element, with no need to implement these behaviors manually. In general, for any elements with nontrivial behavior and semantics that build on top of existing elements of HTML,  will be easier to develop, maintain, and consume.
