h3 4.13.3 Core concepts
text A  is an element that is . Informally, this means that its constructor and prototype are defined by the author, instead of by the user agent. This author-supplied constructor function is called the .
text custom element
link custom https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-custom
text custom element constructor
text Two distinct types of  can be defined:
link "custom elements" #custom-element
button MDN
