text "The way in which  are invoked is done with special care, to avoid running author code during the middle of delicate operations. Effectively, they are delayed until \"just before returning to user script\". This means that for most purposes they appear to execute synchronously, but in the case of complicated composite operations (like , or  manipulation), they will instead be delayed until after all the relevant user agent processing steps have completed, and then run together as a batch."
