text "If the user designates the element with ID \"\" with their pointing device, then the  element (and all its ancestors not shown in the snippet above), the  element, the element with ID \"\", and the element with ID \"\" will match the  . The element with ID \"\" matches it by being ; the  and  elements match it because of the condition in  about flat tree ancestors; and the element with ID \"\" matches it through the additional condition above on  (i.e., its  element matches ). However, the element with ID \"\" does  match : its flat tree descendant is not designated, even though that flat tree descendant matches ."
