text The  are:
text kind strings
text individual
text Indicates a single entity (e.g. a person).
text group
text Indicates multiple entities (e.g. a mailing list).
text org
text Indicates a single entity that is not a person (e.g. a company).
text location
text Indicates a geographical place (e.g. an office building).
text The  are:
text address type strings
text home
text Indicates a delivery address for a residence.
text work
text Indicates a delivery address for a place of work.
text The  are:
text telephone type strings
text home
text Indicates a residential number.
text work
text Indicates a telephone number for a place of work.
text text
text Indicates that the telephone number supports text messages (SMS).
text voice
text Indicates a voice telephone number.
text fax
text Indicates a facsimile telephone number.
text cell
text Indicates a cellular telephone number.
text video
text Indicates a video conferencing telephone number.
text pager
text Indicates a paging device telephone number.
text textphone
text Indicates a telecommunication device for people with hearing or speech difficulties.
text The  are:
text relationship strings
text emergency
text An emergency contact.
text agent
text Another entity that acts on behalf of this entity.
text contact
text acquaintance
text friend
text met
text worker
text colleague
text resident
text neighbor
text child
text parent
text sibling
text spouse
text kin
text muse
text crush
text date
text sweetheart
text me
