h3 5.3.1.2 Examples
text This section is non-normative.
text "Here is a long example vCard for a fictional character called \"Jack Bauer\":"
text Jack  Bauer           Counter-Terrorist Unit ( Los Angeles Division)       10201 W. Pico Blvd.  Los Angeles,  CA  90064  United States   34.052339;-118.410623  Assorted Contact Methods      +1 (310) 597 3781  work       I'm on Wikipedia so you can leave a message on my user talk page.   Jack Bauer Facts   j.bauer@la.ctu.gov.invalid     +1 (310) 555 3781    mobile phone          Update! My new  home phone number is  01632 960 123.
