text "This creates a single item with a two name-value pairs, one with the name \"fn\" and the value \"George Washington\", and the other with the name \"n\" and a second item as its value, the second item having the two name-value pairs \"given-name\" and \"family-name\" with the values \"George\" and \"Washington\" respectively. This is defined to map to the following vCard:"
text "BEGIN:VCARD PROFILE:VCARD VERSION:4.0 SOURCE: FN:George Washington N:Washington;George;;; END:VCARD"
text document's address
