text This is a special variant of user activation, used to allow access to certain session history APIs which, if used too frequently, would make it harder for the user to traverse back using . It starts with a false value, and becomes true whenever the user interacts with , but is reset to false through . This ensures such APIs cannot be used multiple times in a row without an intervening user activation. But unlike , there is no time limit within which such APIs must be used.
