text Note the asymmetry in the sets of  in the page that are affected by an  vs an : an activation consumption changes (to false) the  states for all browsing contexts in the page, but an activation notification changes (to true) the states for a subset of those browsing contexts. The exhaustive nature of consumption here is deliberate: it prevents malicious sites from making multiple calls to an  from a single user activation (possibly by exploiting a deep hierarchy of s). success
