h3 6.4.3 APIs gated by user activation
text APIs that are dependent on user activation are classified into different levels:
text Sticky activation-gated APIs
text These APIs require the  state to be true, so they are blocked until the very first user activation.
link "sticky activation" #sticky-activation
text Transient activation-gated APIs
text These APIs require the  state to be true, but they don't  it, so multiple calls are allowed per user activation until the transient state .
link "transient activation" #transient-activation
link consume #consume-user-activation
link expires #activation-expiry
text Transient activation-consuming APIs
text These APIs require the  state to be true, and they  in each call to prevent multiple calls per user activation.
row
  link "transient activation" #transient-activation
  link "consume user activation" #consume-user-activation
text History-action activation-consuming APIs
text These APIs require the  state to be true, and they  in each call to prevent multiple calls per user activation.
row
  link "history-action activation" #history-action-activation
  link "consume history-action user activation" #consume-history-action-user-activation
