h3 6.9 Find-in-page
h3 6.9.1 Introduction
text This section defines  — a common user-agent mechanism which allows users to search through the contents of the page for particular information.
text find-in-page
text Access to the  feature is provided via a . This is a user-agent provided user interface, which allows the user to specify input and the parameters of the search. This interface can appear as a result of a shortcut or a menu selection.
