h3 6.9.3 Interaction with selection
text The find-in-page process is invoked in the context of a document, and may have an effect on the  of that document. Specifically, the range that defines the  can dictate the current selection. These selection updates, however, can happen at different times during the find-in-page process (e.g. upon the  dismissal or upon a change in the  range).
