text To accept a drop, the drop target has to listen to the following events:
text The  event handler reports whether or not the drop target is potentially willing to accept the drop, by canceling the event.
link dragenter #event-dnd-dragenter
text The  event handler specifies what feedback will be shown to the user, by setting the  attribute of the  associated with the event. This event also needs to be canceled.
