text fireEvents success
text The  algorithm is used in several cases to hide all popovers that don't stay open when something happens. For example, during light-dismiss of a popover, this algorithm ensures that we close only the popovers that aren't related to the node clicked by the user. success
link "hide popover stack until" #hide-popover-stack-until
text To find the , given a  , an  or null , and a boolean , perform the following steps. They return an  or null.
