h3 7.1.4 Cross-origin embedder policies
button ✔MDN
text An  is one of three strings that controls the fetching of cross-origin resources without explicit permission from resource owners.
text embedder policy value
text "\"\""
text unsafe-none
text This is the default value. When this value is used, cross-origin resources can be fetched without giving explicit permission through the  or the `` header.
link "CORS protocol" https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cors-protocol
