text The reason that the property descriptors produced here are configurable is to preserve the  required by the JavaScript specification. In particular, since the value of the property can change as a consequence of navigation, it is required that the property be configurable. (However, see  and references to it elsewhere in this specification for cases where we are not able to preserve these invariants, for compatibility with existing web content.) success
