text The location bar BarProp object
text Historically represented the user interface element that contains a control that displays the browser's location bar.
text The menu bar BarProp object
text Historically represented the user interface element that contains a list of commands in menu form, or some similar interface concept.
text The personal bar BarProp object
text Historically represented the user interface element that contains links to the user's favorite pages, or some similar interface concept.
text The scrollbar BarProp object
text Historically represented the user interface element that contains a scrolling mechanism, or some similar interface concept.
text The status bar BarProp object
text Historically represented a user interface element found immediately below or after the document, as appropriate for the user's media, which typically provides information about ongoing network activity or information about elements that the user's pointing device is currently indicating.
text The toolbar BarProp object
text Historically represented the user interface element found immediately above or before the document, as appropriate for the user's media, which typically provides  controls (back and forward buttons, reload buttons, etc.).
