text Consider a game where the user can navigate along a line, such that the user is always at some coordinate, and such that the user can bookmark the page corresponding to a particular coordinate, to return to it later.
text A static page implementing the x=5 position in such a game could look like the following:
text Line Game - 5 You are at coordinate 5 on the line.   Advance to 6 or  retreat to 4?
