h3 7.2.6.10 The navigate event
text A major feature of the navigation API is the  event. This event is fired on any navigation (in the ), allowing web developers to monitor such outgoing navigations. In many cases, the event is , which allows preventing the navigation from happening. And in others, the navigation can be intercepted and replaced with a same-document navigation by using the  method of the  class.
