text The  option can be a function that accepts a  and returns a promise. The precommit handler function will run after the  event has finished firing, but before the  property has been updated. Returning a rejected promise will abort the navigation and its effect, such as updating the URL and session history. After all the precommit handlers are fulfilled, the navigation can proceed to commit and call the rest of the handlers. The  option can only be passed when the event is : trying to pass a  to a non-cancelable  will throw a  . success
