text There is a subtle timing difference between how  schedules its success and failure steps when given zero promises versus ≥1 promises. For most uses of , this does not matter. However, with this API, there are so many events and promise handlers which could fire around the same time that the difference is pretty easily observable: it can cause the event/promise handler sequence to vary. (Some of the events and promises involved include:  / , , , 's promises, and the  promise.) success
