text are a powerful tool for visualizing the interactions of multiple navigables, navigations, and traversals. They cannot capture every possible interaction — for example, they only work with a single level of nesting — but we will have ocassion to use them to illustrate several complex situations throughout this standard.
link "Jake diagrams" #jake-diagram
text are named after their creator, the inimitable Jake Archibald. success
