h3 7.4.6 Applying the history step
text For both navigation and traversal, once we have an idea of where we want to head to in the session history, much of the work comes about in applying that notion to the  and the relevant . For navigations, this work generally occurs toward the end of the process; for traversals, it is the beginning.
