h3 7.4.6.1 Updating the traversable
text Ensuring a  ends up at the right session history step is particularly complex, as it can involve coordinating across multiple  descendants of the traversable,  them in parallel, and then synchronizing back up to ensure everyone has the same view of the result. This is further complicated by the existence of synchronous same-document navigations being mixed together with cross-document navigations, and how web pages have come to have certain relative timing expectations.
