text In this standard, every call to  is given just a , and the algorithm re-computes all possible candidates in a stateless way. A real implementation would likely cache previous computations, and pass along information from the call site to make updates more efficient. For example, if an  element's  attribute is changed, that specific element could be passed along in order to update only the related . success
