text "This step will create a single group containing them both, in the given order. (The second pass through will not create a group, since its contents would be the same as the first group, just in a different order.) This means that if the user agent chooses to execute the \"may\" step below to enact the group, it will enact the first candidate, and ignore the second. Thus, the request will be made with the , instead of using \"\"."
