text The  parameter is intended to be used for running scripts even if scripting is disabled. This is required for some automation scenarios, e.g. for . When the scripting process (e.g., executing a script via a WebDriver BiDi command) is invoked with  set to true, the event loop is allowed to run to resolve thenables (from promises) and weakmap finalizations created by that script, even if . This is necessary to ensure the proper functioning of testing scripts, which often rely on asynchronous operations. success
