h3 8.6.3.1 Configuration invariants
text This section is non-normative.
text Configurations can and ought to be modified by developers to suit their purposes. Options are to write a new  dictionary from scratch, to modify an existing 's configuration by using the modifier methods, or to  an existing 's  as a dictionary and modify the dictionary and then create a new  with it.
