text An  object  with width equal to the  attribute and height equal to the  attribute. The pixel values of this bitmap are stored in the  attribute in left-to-right order, row by row from top to bottom, starting with 0 for the top left pixel, with the order and numerical representation of the color components of each pixel determined by the  attribute. The color space of the pixel values of the bitmap is determined by the  attribute.
