h3 9.2.1 Introduction
text This section is non-normative.
text To enable servers to push data to web pages over HTTP or using dedicated server-push protocols, this specification introduces the  interface.
link EventSource #eventsource
text Using this API consists of creating an  object and registering an event listener.
