text When posting a message to a  of a  that has just been navigated to a new  is likely to result in the message not receiving its intended recipient: the scripts in the target  have to have had time to set up listeners for the messages. Thus, for instance, in situations where a message is to be sent to the  of newly created child , authors are advised to have the child  post a message to their parent announcing their readiness to receive messages, and for the parent to wait for this message before beginning posting messages. success
