h3 10.1.2.3 Shared workers introduction
button ✔MDN
text This section is non-normative.
text This section introduces shared workers using a Hello World example. Shared workers use slightly different APIs, since each worker can have multiple connections.
text This first example shows how you connect to a worker and how a worker can send a message back to the page when it connects to it. Received messages are displayed in a log.
text Here is the HTML page:
