text A user agent has an  value, the , which is some amount of time. This represents how long the user agent allows shared workers which the web developer has requested be given an extended lifetime, to survive and perform work after all of their  have disappeared. User agents should choose a value that is equal to the longest lifetime that a service worker can stay alive without any , and must not choose a value that is longer than that amount of time.
