text If the new encoding is identical or equivalent to the encoding that is already being used to interpret the input stream, then set the  to  and return. This happens when the encoding information found in the file matches what the  determined to be the encoding, and in the second pass through the parser if the first pass found that the encoding sniffing algorithm described in the earlier section failed to find the right encoding.
