text reconsume
link "next input character" #next-input-character
link "current input character" #current-input-character
text The exact behavior of certain states depends on the  and the . Certain states also use a  to track progress, and the  uses a  to return to the state it was invoked from.
link "insertion mode" #insertion-mode
