text When a token is emitted, it must immediately be handled by the  stage. The tree construction stage can affect the state of the tokenization stage, and can insert additional characters into the stream. (For example, the  element can result in scripts executing and using the  APIs to insert characters into the stream being tokenized.)
link "tree construction" #tree-construction
