text User agents may implement an optimization, as described in this section, to speculatively fetch resources that are declared in the HTML markup while the HTML parser is waiting for a  to be fetched and executed, or during normal parsing, at the time . While this optimization is not defined in precise detail, there are some rules to consider for interoperability.
