h3 13.5 Named character references
text This table lists the  names that are supported by HTML, and the code points to which they refer. It is referenced by the previous sections.
link "character reference" #syntax-charref
text It is intentional, for legacy compatibility, that many code points have multiple character reference names. For example, some appear both with and without the trailing semicolon, or with different capitalizations. success
